#: ui/main.qml:289
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@option:check part of a complete sentence: 'Middle click pastes selected text'"
msgid "Pastes selected text"
msgstr "Pega o texto seleccionado."

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/main.qml:306
#, kde-format
msgid "Touch Mode:"
msgstr "Modo táctil:"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/main.qml:308
#, kde-format
msgctxt "As in: 'Touch Mode is automatically enabled as needed'"
msgid "Automatically enable as needed"
msgstr "Activar automaticamente cando se necesite"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/main.qml:308 ui/main.qml:353
#, kde-format
msgctxt "As in: 'Touch Mode is never enabled'"
msgid "Never enabled"
msgstr "Non activar nunca"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/main.qml:325
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Touch Mode will be automatically activated whenever the system detects a touch"
"screen but no mouse or touchpad. For example: when a transformable laptop's ke"
"yboard is flipped around or detached."
msgstr ""
"O modo táctil activarase automaticamente cando o sistema detecta unha pantalla"
" táctil e ningún rato ou área táctil. Por exemplo,  cando ao teclado dun portá"
"til transformábel se lle dá a volta ou se desconecta."

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/main.qml:330
#, kde-format
msgctxt "As in: 'Touch Mode is always enabled'"
msgid "Always enabled"
msgstr "Sempre activo"

#. +> trunk6 stable6 stable5
#: ui/main.qml:376
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In Touch Mode, many elements of the user interface will become larger to more "
"easily accommodate touch interaction."
msgstr ""
"No modo táctil, moitos elementos da interface aumentan de tamaño para facilita"
"r a interacción táctil."

#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: ui/main.qml:394
#, kde-format
msgid "Double-click interval:"
msgstr "Intervalo de clic duplo:"

